---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>The autophagy stack</h1>
			<p>
				Autophagy is the closest thing your cells have to a self-cleaning cycle. It clears
				damaged proteins, recycles dysfunctional mitochondria, and is one of the strongest
				cellular signals associated with healthy ageing. Five practices reliably trigger it:
				fasting, exercise, cold immersion, sauna, and hypoxic breathing.
			</p>
			<p>
				This site is a practitioner's notebook on each of them. No supplements, no magic,
				no hand-waving. Just what the literature actually says and what works in real weeks
				of training.
			</p>
			<p>
				The companion iOS app, also called Autophagy, lets you log all five practices in one
				place and pulls HRV, resting heart rate, sleep, and VO2 max from Apple Health so you
				can see which combinations are moving your numbers. In development now.
			</p>

			<h2>Start here</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<a href="/blog/what-is-autophagy/">What is autophagy? A practitioner's guide for athletes</a>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				More articles on each of the five practices are on the way.
				<a href="/blog/">Browse the archive</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
